        "Every process has a PID, a parent, a user context and resources; services are background processes started by the OS. Windows boot chain: `System` (PID 4) → `smss.exe` → `wininit.exe` → `services.exe` and `lsass.exe`; `winlogon.exe` launches `userinit.exe`, which starts `explorer.exe` and exits.",
