        "Inspection trade-offs: privacy and legal concerns (banking and healthcare categories are often exempt), performance cost and broken apps that use **certificate pinning**. Malware can also pin to evade inspection, so uninspectable 443 traffic to odd destinations deserves a look. Without decryption, rely on metadata: SNI, certificate details, JA3/JA4 fingerprints, flow sizes and timing.",
