        "**Staging archives**: new `.zip`, `.7z` or `.rar` files (often password protected to defeat DLP inspection) in Temp, AppData or the Desktop, created by cmd, PowerShell or a script engine. Detect with Sysmon EID 11 (file create) by extension, location and creating process.",
        "**Cloud storage abuse**: uploads to OneDrive, Google Drive, Dropbox or S3 by PowerShell, cmd or `rclone` rather than by the sync client or a browser. Evidence: EDR per-process network telemetry, CloudTrail S3 data events, GuardDuty `Exfiltration:S3/AnomalousBehavior`.",
