        "GeoIP uses: impossible travel (two sign-ins, two IPs, two locations: could anyone cover that distance in the time between?), traffic to countries with no business ties, scoping hunts. VPNs, Tor exits, proxies and cloud hosting show the relay's location, so GeoIP is context, not attribution.",
