        "**Sandbox evasion**: malware sleeps past the analysis window, checks for VM artifacts, sandbox registry keys, small disks or missing user activity, or needs a specific locale. Good sandboxes simulate users and delay execution. A sample that refuses to run is a clue, and a clean report never proves a file is safe.",
