        "**Process**: identify actors relevant to your industry, geography and incident history (finance: FIN7, APT38; critical infrastructure: Sandworm, Volt Typhoon) → export their techniques from attack.mitre.org/groups and import them into Navigator as a layer → rate coverage green (detected), yellow (partial) or red (none) → prioritize detection engineering on the red cells.",
