        "**Consistent secure baselines** baked into modules: correct security groups on every instance, public access blocked on every storage bucket, least-privilege IAM roles, logging and GuardDuty enabled in every region. Nobody can forget a step.",
        "**Pre-deployment scanning**: Checkov (open source) scans Terraform, CloudFormation, Kubernetes manifests and Helm charts for misconfigurations before anything is deployed.",
