        "**Vulnerability dashboards** give a live view: open findings by severity and age, new versus closed, SLA compliance, top 10 vulnerabilities and assets, KEV-listed exposures and accepted exceptions. Build views per audience: owners see their queue and due dates; managers see SLA breaches and blockers; executives see risk trends and accepted risk.",
        "**Remediation effectiveness**: the share of findings marked fixed that are actually clean on a validation rescan. Example: 480 closed, 60 still detected = 420 / 480 = **87.5 percent**. Require a clean rescan before closing tickets.",
        "**SLA compliance rate** = findings fixed within the window / findings that came due. Report late fixes and open exceptions separately rather than counting them as successes.",
        "**Coverage** keeps the numbers honest: percentage of assets scanned in the last 30 days, credentialed scan success rate and assets missing agents. A falling vulnerability count means little if coverage also fell.",
