        "Translate severity into business risk: not 'CVSS 9.8 on the web server' but 'an unpatched flaw on the system that processes customer payments could let an attacker take full control without logging in, putting customer data and compliance at risk.' The strongest proof of value is usually MTTR falling (e.g. criticals from 45 to 12 days).",
