        "**Five whys**: ransomware, because of phishing, because a user clicked, because the gateway missed it, because novel obfuscation beat signature-only detection, because the sandbox bought 18 months ago was never deployed. Root cause = an undeployed control; fix = deploy it by a date with an owner, not 'more phishing training'.",
